      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Les Expositions des Arts Incohérents",
      "links": [],
      "level": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Anon.: \"Bas Relief\",\n1882 [Stocking nailed on wooden plank]\n\n(Illustration based on reconstruction\nby Présence Panchouette, 1988.)\n\n\n\nUmbrella entitled \"Sarah Bernardt\", 1884.\n\n\n\nMiss Ella: \"La nouvelle niche à\nsaints\", 1886. [Corset]\n\n\n\nTrousers entitled \"Tour Eiiffel\", 1889.",
      "links": []
